  "summary_en": "Saudi master's researcher's article surveying arguments for and against granting robots legal personality, comparing positions of states and international bodies including the European Parliament's 2017 resolution. Concludes robots are not yet recognised as legal persons and urges legislators to define robots' legal nature clearly while protecting patients and encouraging innovation.",
